    "message": "Guidelines require baseline and ongoing fasting blood glucose monitoring for patients on DTG, with DM risk factor assessment using a screening tool. This patient has multiple DM risk factors (obesity, acanthosis nigricans, impaired fasting glucose, family history) yet no clinician assessment or plan was documented today. No orders for repeat fasting glucose, HbA1c, or formal DM screening were recorded. The guideline algorithm requires reassessment every six months or when clinically indicated, and this encounter is clearly clinically indicated by new metabolic abnormalities.",
